  {
   "text": "It publishes a 'new post' event and returns to the author right away. The fan-out happens later.",
   "nodes": [
    "post",
    "q"
   ],
   "edges": [
    "post>q"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Fan-out workers pull the event and page through the author's followers in the follow graph.",
   "nodes": [
    "wk",
    "q",
    "graph"
   ],
   "edges": [
    "wk>q",
    "wk>graph"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "They prepend the post id to every follower's timeline: 300 followers, 300 small writes, a few seconds behind the post.",
   "nodes": [
